<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Outpatient (OPD) Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Optimize your clinic workflow with high-standard clinical tools that combine 
            speed of service with rigorous medical documentation and patient safety.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Triage & Vital Signs Monitoring</h2>
        <p>
            The OPD journey begins with professional triage. Nurses capture vital signs—including 
            blood pressure, heart rate, temperature, oxygen saturation, and weight—directly into 
            the patient's record. The system calculates Early Warning Scores (EWS) 
            automatically, flagging high-risk patients for immediate clinical priority on 
            the doctor's dashboard. This structured intake ensures that clinicians enter 
            every consultation with a complete preliminary health profile.
        </p>
        <p>
            Queue management dashboards allow management to monitor waiting times across 
            different clinics (General Practitioner, Specialist, Antenatal), ensuring 
            that patient flow remains within established service standards.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">High-fidelity Clinical Consultations</h2>
        <p>
            Empower doctors with a structured digital workspace. Consultation notes follow the 
            globally recognized SOAP format (Subjective, Objective, Assessment, Plan), 
            ensuring comprehensive and professional medical records. Integration with 
            ICD-10 (International Classification of Diseases) allows for the precise 
            coding of diagnoses, which is essential for accurate clinical analytics 
            and medical aid claim validity.
        </p>
        <p>
            Doctors have instant access to the patient's entire medical history—including 
            previous diagnoses, chronic conditions, and allergy lists—enabling better 
            informed clinical decisions and improved patient outcomes.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Closed-loop Ordering & Prescribing</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate errors from manual transcription. Laboratory tests and Radiology 
            investigations are ordered directly from the consultation screen, transmitting 
            orders instantly to the relevant departments. Digital prescriptions are 
            authorized and sent electronically to the internal Pharmacy, with 
            integrated checks for drug-to-drug interactions and known patient 
            allergies.
        </p>
        <p>
            This integrated ecosystem ensures that the entire care plan—from diagnosis to 
            treatment—is tracked in a single, authoritative audit trail, providing 
            absolute transparency for medical stewardship and billing.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

